  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">RONDOOZ is a Barcelona-based Wearable Art House creating One of One and Limited Edition collectible garments. Every piece is individually hand-painted by the artist and finished with artist-executed embellishments. No printed imagery is used. Selected works incorporate antique Gobelin textiles, creating collectible pieces that exist between fashion and fine art.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• What makes us different:</p><p>* Original hand-painted artworks, not prints</p><p>* One of One and Limited Edition releases</p><p>* Individually numbered and authenticated pieces</p><p>* Barcelona-based independent art house</p><p>* Collectible wearable art created for collectors, not trends</p><p>* Premium product values ranging from accessible editions to museum-level unique works</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>Affiliates earn 15% commission on every successful sale generated through their referral link or discount code. We provide a dedicated affiliate dashboard with transparent tracking, real-time performance monitoring, and commission reporting.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• How to promote us:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Share your affiliate link, personal discount code, social media content, newsletters, blog articles, videos, reviews, styling content, and artistic storytelling related to the brand and its collections.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">RONDOOZ does not run public discounts. Affiliate partners receive access to exclusive creator codes that offer special benefits to their audience while maintaining the exclusivity of the brand. We are particularly interested in collaborating with creators, artists, fashion professionals, luxury enthusiasts, collectors, and culture-focused communities.</p></div></div>",
